  "description": "Polly v8 resilience for RabbitMQ.Client v7+ — retry, circuit-breaker, and timeout for IChannel operations, with built-in RabbitMqTransientErrors predicate covering AlreadyClosedException, BrokerUnreachableException, OperationInterruptedException, and ConnectFailureException. Includes automatic channel recreation between retries.",
