  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.3: Add net10.0 target framework support. 1.0.2: Fix package icon (was showing an incorrect/placeholder image). 1.0.0: Initial release. ResilientChannel wraps IChannel with Polly v8 retry, circuit-breaker, and timeout. RabbitMqTransientErrors exposes a pre-built ShouldHandle predicate. Automatic channel recreation between retries. Supports net6.0, net8.0, net9.0, and net10.0.",
